BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ec68795e-beee-484c-b8c0-7b6a837b9c55
DTSTAMP:20260223T191723Z
DTSTART:2026-02-26T18:00:00+00:00
DTEND:2026-02-26T19:30:00+00:00
SUMMARY:Free Food @ Creative Practice Lab: Lunch Day with Artist Dario Robleto
DESCRIPTION:Join us at University Galleries for the inaugural semester of the Creative Practice Lab (CPL)! Socialize with other students and arts professionals; participate in professional development activities; and help shape future semesters of the group. Free food at all meetings and free to participate. Register for each event at: https://linktr.ee/universitygalleriesisu

 

At this event, lunch with internationally recognized artist Dario Robleto. Join other students and University Galleries’ team for a casual lunch and conversation with the artist. Robleto will be in town for a film screening on February 24 and lecture on February 25.

 

**Registration is limited to 20 currently enrolled ISU students. The registration form will be closed once capacity has been reached. If you have any questions, please contact Gallery@IllinoisState.edu.
LOCATION:University Galleries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c5e6fade-ccf8-4cb5-bb94-a5df1f2c6a65
